# Shared PostgreSQL instance (pgvector/pg17)
# Serves: LiteLLM (litellm db), n8n (n8n db), reserved (appdb).
# FastAPI uses its OWN dedicated fastapi-postgres container, NOT this one.
#
# This .env holds ONLY the 4 Azure bootstrap credentials so that
# load-secrets.sh can authenticate to the Key Vault. All database passwords
# (POSTGRES_PASSWORD, LITELLM/N8N/APPDB) are pulled from the vault at deploy
# time and injected via docker-compose 'environment:' interpolation.
#
# Copy to .env and fill in from the Service Principal (Runbook 1.4).
AZURE_TENANT_ID=
AZURE_CLIENT_ID=
AZURE_CLIENT_SECRET=
AZURE_KEY_VAULT_URL=https://<your-kv>.vault.azure.net/
